xplore cinq univers différents cette semaine, à ton rythme.","universe":"","requirements":{"metric":"visits","goal":5},"period":"week","reward_kind":"badge","reward_label":"Les cinq horizons","source_url":"","enabled":true,"secret":false},{"id":"awakening-trio","kind":"mission","title":"Trois lumières","description":"Débloque l’Éveil de trois cartes différentes. Aucun exemplaire n’est consommé.","universe":"","requirements":{"metric":"awakenings","goal":3},"period":"once","reward_kind":"decoration","reward_label":"Trio lumineux","source_url":"","enabled":true,"secret":false},{"id":"festival-des-liens-draft","kind":"event","title":"Festival des liens","description":"Brouillon à personnaliser : réunis dix personnages différents pour obtenir l’insigne du festival. Vérifie les dates avant de publier.","universe":"","requirements":{"metric":"total","goal":10},"period":"once","reward_kind":"badge","reward_label":"Souvenir du Festival des liens","source_url":"","starts_at":"2026-11-07T00:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-14T00:00:00Z","enabled":false,"secret":false}]$content$::jsonb) as x(id text,kind text,title text,description text,universe text,requirements jsonb,period text,reward_kind text,reward_label text,source_url text,starts_at timestamptz,ends_at timestamptz,enabled boolean,secret boolean) on conflict(id) do nothing;
